MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=3
RELEASE_VERSION=0
PRERELEASE=1
DEV_VERSION=3
DESCRIPTION<<PROMOTE_DESC_END
4.3.0: Wi-Fi #328 production tail — RFC 7664 Dragonfly SAE (group 19 hunt-and-peck PWE via HMAC-SHA256 keyed by ordered MACs and IEEE KDF-Hash "SAE Hunting and Pecking" with prime context; commit/confirm; PMK/KCK) wired through connect OTA and mock AP using existing net_wifi_sae / net_endian / net_asm surfaces (802.11 LSB-first group and send-confirm via asm_net_store_le16; no new contract files); SAE anti-clogging token encoded after the group identifier and before the scalar; association requests carry Capability Information plus the mandatory Supported Rates IE; unassociated nl80211 management TX includes NL80211_ATTR_WIPHY_FREQ from scan BSS frequency; TWT uses IEEE S1G action category 22; mgmt OTA Phase 2 (Tasks 2.1–2.5), SAE/EAPOL connect OTA unit tests (test_wifi_connect_ota), TWT Individual Setup/Teardown Action frames OTA (wifi_twt_ota), in-tree fl_net_dhcp_acquire post-association on physical/lab netdev, lab gated behind FL_NET_WIFI_LAB, mac80211_hwsim optional CI (FL_NET_WIFI_HWSIM_OK), physical nl80211 connect/DHCP, server single-IP bind on WSL; TWT power-manager schedules the next service period from negotiated params, sleeps until the SP boundary, and cancels on teardown/connect failure (no stale flow_id); ./scripts/validate_issue_328.sh installs deps and applies WSL/Linux firewall rules then runs #328 gates (make test_p3_network required; optional hwsim hostapd SAE/WPA2 via make test_p3_wifi_ota; UART skipped without /dev/ttyUSB*|ttyACM*); CI wifi-issue-328 job keeps logs/pcaps; validate script matches the #328 playbook (discover hwsim ifaces, hostapd channel 6 -dd, tcpdump EAPOL/mgmt, tshark decode, optional wifi-ap netns, make test_p3_wifi_ota IFACE=/SSID=/AUTH=, UART AT probe, no ROADMAP flip); make test_p3_wifi / test_p3_wifi_ota / test_wifi_80211ax_mock_279 list kmalloc.o, mem_domain.o, and wifi_platform_*.o as prerequisites so the CI Issue job links without a prior full make; validator dumps make logs on FAIL.
PROMOTE_DESC_END

RELEASE_DATE=2026-08-12
